      "why": "The 31.8 % figure was derived from undocumented arithmetic and does not match any reproducible measurement; the only measured numbers are 0.23 % vs 39.1 % (≈ 170 × reduction). The claim is therefore unsupported and has been retracted.",
      "action": "Remove the 31.8 % figure from all documentation and replace it with the measured ratio; do not use it for budgeting."
    },
    {
      "claim": "Horizontal LED‑flicker banding is a real nuisance term that must be filtered",
      "why": "Camera‑Flicker‑Banding was withdrawn after the stride bug was fixed; the banding disappears (0 % in empty room). The claim is a false positive.",
      "action": "Delete the banding‑filter requirement from the roadmap; focus on genuine motion signals instead."
    },
    {
      "claim": "The audio‑only channel is dead for speaker‑change detection",
      "why": "CLOUD‑MULTIMODAL shows a usable speech‑presence signal (sensitivity 0.667, FPR 0), contradicting the “audio dead” narrative. The claim is contradicted by measured evidence.",
      "action": "Re‑evaluate audio‑channel utility; keep the audio pipeline for speech‑presence detection."
    },
